'''One of Three''' is an [[:Category:Enemies|enemy]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found wandering designated spawn [[Locations|areas]] that include: West of the [[Greenwood Forest]] [[Warpstones|warpstone]], near a [[Bumbleberry Patch|bumbleberry patch]] located in [[Queensfields]], and south of a cave in the [[Cobblestone Village]].

==Trivia==
*One of Three was introduced in-game on October 1st, 2013. 
